<title>FRANCE: Bouygues sees 1996 result similar to 1994.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sees 1996 result similar to 1994.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction group Bouygues said on Tuesday it expected group result for 1996 to be similar to that of 1994, due in particular to capital gains on divestments.</p>
<p>The group made a profit of 573 million francs in 1994.</p>
</text>
